0:{"buildId":"HaSH0nfWkwbFYqcaqq3RQ","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"x:mx-auto x:flex x:max-w-(--nextra-content-width)","children":["$","$L2",null,{"value":[{"value":"Property","id":"property","depth":2},{"value":"Type","id":"type","depth":2},{"value":"Usage","id":"usage","depth":2},{"value":"Related Properties","id":"related-properties","depth":2}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{}],["$","$L4",null,{"metadata":{"title":"isConnecting","filePath":"content/hooks/useWalletConnect/isConnecting.mdx","timestamp":1770719093000},"sourceCode":"# isConnecting\n\nBoolean indicating whether a connection is in progress.\n\n## Property\n\n`isConnecting: boolean`\n\n## Type\n\n`boolean` - `true` if connection is in progress, `false` otherwise\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\n  import { useWalletConnect } from \"__PACKAGE_NAME__\";\n\n  function ConnectionButton() {\n    const { openModal, isConnecting, isConnected } = useWalletConnect();\n\n    if (isConnecting) {\n      return <button disabled>Connecting...</button>;\n    }\n\n    return (\n      <button onClick={openModal}>\n        {isConnected ? \"Connected\" : \"Connect Wallet\"}\n      </button>\n    );\n  }\n\n```\n\n## Related Properties\n\n- `isConnected` - Connection status\n- `isOpenModal` - Modal open status\n- `error` - Error state if connection fails","children":[["$","div",null,{"id":"nextra-skip-nav"}],["$","main",null,{"data-pagefind-body":true,"children":[["$","h1",null,{"className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-bold x:mt-2 x:text-4xl","children":["isConnecting","$undefined"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"x:not-first:mt-[1.25em] x:leading-7","children":"Boolean indicating whether a connection is in progress."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"property","className":"x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border","children":["Property",["$","$L5",null,{"id"